// Application resources of the launcher.
//
// The icon is shared by every executable of the repository and lives in the
// docs directory. The resource compiler resolves this relative path through its
// search path, which contains the directory of this file (CMake passes the
// include directories of the target to the resource compiler).
//
// IDI_ICON1 is the icon group of the launcher executable, and Windows shows the
// first group of the resource directory order for a file, so this group is what
// Explorer shows for the extracted program.
//
// A packed launcher carries a second icon group as well: the packer appends the
// icon of the packaged application below a resource name which the resource
// directory orders before this one (see src/core/ApplicationIcon.cpp), so
// Explorer shows the icon of the packaged application for the extracted
// program while this group stays the icon of the launcher.
IDI_ICON1 ICON DISCARDABLE "../docs/icon.ico"
